{"title":"2017 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/6/9160cdc15662f61cc57e3950f2bf176773a68308.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{4} - 3x^{3} + x^{2} - 3x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"184\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factoring out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/4/b345374e979050fdcb47e79fe1cfe0a37ac02065.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x^{3} - 3x^{2} + x - 3) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"191\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/3/d935307a995903d0a1445f9f469fef7117e2682d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x^{2}(x - 3) + 1(x - 3)) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"221\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/d/96d69ccfda951e7006f5dfdc49c7acbfa8756a0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x^{2} + 1)(x - 3) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"165\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/f/2af2a0030989e7b1ecdb7edb2193620241dbe925.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" /> has no real factors since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/e/a6e87b69178d197c13b13d595e7e6817cf20df95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" /> is always non-negative if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is a real number, making <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/f/2af2a0030989e7b1ecdb7edb2193620241dbe925.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" /> always positive.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/c/8dc2c1c01b0984c42d43fc6a1d3651192b750d92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"57\" height=\"25\" /> works as a solution.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddf82c45c1241a963ba5e2b4d74780dfa225daa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"57\" height=\"25\" /> works as a solution.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CSMC\" title=\"2017 CSMC\">2017 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2017 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2017 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2017 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2017 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018061600\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 100/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1283/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 134/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2209/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.016      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%    8.016      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37326:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018061600 and revision id 288245. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}